WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
You know what a bunch of well-fed college students they are.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,680
Now that the yin energy of heaven and earth has revived, ordinary people are doing this

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,160
It's easy to really attract some unclean things

4
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:07,120
You are a student of the school now

5
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,640
It's easier to move around than our field agents

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:09,760
This is not considered a formal field assignment.

7
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,360
Count your extracurricular job as revenge

8
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,360
As long as you settle this matter

9
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:14,680
According to the legislation, you have to pay all the financial aid fees for the first semester of your sophomore year.

10
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:17,680
In addition, Captain Chen can rest assured to protect the physical and mental health of his classmates with an additional RMB 2,000 dining subsidy.

11
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:20,000
It was I who was given the unshirkable responsibility of young people.

12
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,740
It will definitely be done beautifully for you

13
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:27,180
Choose this urgent place for activity

14
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:28,940
The leaders of this group

15
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,220
If not a knowledgeable person

16
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:46,180
He's just a stupid classmate, who are you looking for?
